{{!
    @template theme_dimensions/category_daterange

    The one date control of the design: a start box and an end box side by
    side, each with its own control that clears it, and ONE popover holding
    two months that both boxes open. Either bound may be set alone; the server
    states what each keeps (criteria).

    Only the client module (daterange) renders it. A reader without JavaScript
    gets the toolbar's two native date fields, which stay in the document under
    this control and keep carrying the two parameters the form posts; that is
    why the toolbar mounts it into an empty region rather than drawing a
    skeleton of it.

    Each box is a button and not an input: its value is never typed and it
    opens a disclosure. Both carry the same aria-controls, the popover's id,
    because they open the same one, and which bound a press of a day sets is
    the box that opened it (data-bound, the parameter's own name). A box's name
    is its label followed by its date; once a date is set the label leaves the
    picture (visually-hidden) and stays in the name. No dialogue role: nothing
    is trapped and Escape returns the focus to the box.

    The month grids are left empty on purpose: the day names come from the
    browser's formatter in the document's language and the column a week begins
    under is the site's, facts that arrive after this template has rendered. The
    client writes the grids, their rows and their cells, with the roving
    tabindex, the roles and the grid's label (its month's caption). The second
    month is the client's to show or hide by width. The prompt above the months
    says which bound the next press sets.

    A press describes a period and applies nothing: the popover stays open on
    the draft until the footer's "Done" applies it. The footer's control drops
    the whole period and carries the same action as each box's own control,
    which drops that box's bound alone (data-bound), so one handler serves all
    three.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "fromid": "dim-daterange-7-from",
        "toid": "dim-daterange-7-to",
        "popid": "dim-daterange-pop-7",
        "fromvalue": "17 Sep 2026",
        "tovalue": "",
        "hasfrom": true,
        "hasto": false,
        "prompt": "Choose the last day",
        "month": "September 2026",
        "nextmonth": "October 2026"
    }
}}
<div class="dim-daterange" data-region="dim-daterange-field">
    <div class="dim-daterange__boxes" role="group" aria-label="{{#str}}category_daterange, theme_dimensions{{/str}}">
        <div class="dim-daterange__box">
            <button class="form-control dim-daterange__field" type="button" id="{{fromid}}" data-action="dim-daterange-open" data-bound="from" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="{{popid}}">
                <i class="fa fa-calendar-days dim-daterange__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                <span class="dim-daterange__label{{#hasfrom}} visually-hidden{{/hasfrom}}" data-region="dim-daterange-label">{{#str}}category_datefrom, theme_dimensions{{/str}}</span>
                <span class="dim-daterange__value" data-region="dim-daterange-value">{{fromvalue}}</span>
            </button>
            <button class="dim-daterange__clear" type="button" data-action="dim-daterange-clear" data-bound="from"{{^hasfrom}} hidden{{/hasfrom}}>
                <i class="fa fa-xmark" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="visually-hidden">{{#str}}category_dateclearfrom, theme_dimensions{{/str}}</span>
            </button>
        </div>
        <div class="dim-daterange__box">
            <button class="form-control dim-daterange__field" type="button" id="{{toid}}" data-action="dim-daterange-open" data-bound="to" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="{{popid}}">
                <i class="fa fa-calendar-days dim-daterange__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                <span class="dim-daterange__label{{#hasto}} visually-hidden{{/hasto}}" data-region="dim-daterange-label">{{#str}}category_dateto, theme_dimensions{{/str}}</span>
                <span class="dim-daterange__value" data-region="dim-daterange-value">{{tovalue}}</span>
            </button>
            <button class="dim-daterange__clear" type="button" data-action="dim-daterange-clear" data-bound="to"{{^hasto}} hidden{{/hasto}}>
                <i class="fa fa-xmark" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="visually-hidden">{{#str}}category_dateclearto, theme_dimensions{{/str}}</span>
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="dim-daterange__pop" id="{{popid}}" data-region="dim-daterange-pop" hidden>
        <div class="dim-daterange__nav">
            <button class="dim-daterange__step" type="button" data-action="dim-daterange-prev"><i class="fa fa-chevron-left" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="visually-hidden">{{#str}}category_dateprevmonth, theme_dimensions{{/str}}</span></button>
            <p class="dim-daterange__prompt" data-region="dim-daterange-prompt" aria-live="polite">{{prompt}}</p>
            <button class="dim-daterange__step" type="button" data-action="dim-daterange-next"><i class="fa fa-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="visually-hidden">{{#str}}category_datenextmonth, theme_dimensions{{/str}}</span></button>
        </div>
        <div class="dim-daterange__months">
            <div class="dim-daterange__monthblock" data-region="dim-daterange-monthblock">
                <span class="dim-daterange__month" id="{{popid}}-month-0" data-region="dim-daterange-month" aria-live="polite">{{month}}</span>
                <div class="dim-daterange__grid" data-region="dim-daterange-grid"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="dim-daterange__monthblock" data-region="dim-daterange-monthblock">
                <span class="dim-daterange__month" id="{{popid}}-month-1" data-region="dim-daterange-month" aria-live="polite">{{nextmonth}}</span>
                <div class="dim-daterange__grid" data-region="dim-daterange-grid"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="dim-daterange__footer">
            <button class="btn btn-link btn-sm dim-daterange__footerclear" type="button" data-action="dim-daterange-clear">{{#str}}category_dateclear, theme_dimensions{{/str}}</button>
            <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm dim-daterange__done" type="button" data-action="dim-daterange-done">{{#str}}category_datedone, theme_dimensions{{/str}}</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
